# Minimal Hyprland desktop: the compositor, a terminal and the desktop
# plumbing only. No display manager: users log in on the console (tty1) and
# Hyprland starts through the .bash_profile hook shipped by
# legit-hyprland-config. No bar, launcher or file manager is imposed - users
# bring their own dotfiles.
hyprland
kitty
swaybg
xdg-user-dirs
virtualbox-guest-utils
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
qt5-wayland
qt6-wayland
polkit-kde-agent
grim
slurp
wl-clipboard
pipewire
pipewire-audio
pipewire-pulse
wireplumber
rtkit
